title: FirstBattleDialogue
---
Emilia: A Widow outside the caves in Konztanza... It's been five years since I've been this close to one.
Widow: <b>SNARL</b>
Emilia: Disturbing the peace in this beautiful castle... How nauseating.
Widow: <b>HISSS</b>
Emilia: I don't mind playing exterminator today.
Dodge the enemies attack and fight back by charging up each rose
<<StartBattle BattleManager>>
